*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
__pycache__
.DS_Store
*.txt
.qodo
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.sqlite
*.lock
.coverage
.env
resources/failed_downloads.json
# Per-user deferred-download state (live/premiere URLs awaiting airtime).
# load_pending_queue() returns [] when the file is absent, so a clean checkout is fine.
resources/pending_queue.json
# Legacy live-queue file the pending-queue migration renames on first run.
resources/live_queue.txt.migrated
# yt-dlp verbose capture (VID_DL_YTDLP_VERBOSE). Contains PO tokens, visitor data
# and signed media URLs -- never commit it. Covers the rotation backups too.
resources/ytdlp_debug.log*
dist/
build/
installer_output/
# Editable-install metadata regenerated by `uv pip install -e .`; committing it
# freezes Settings -> About's version display at whatever it read at commit time.
*.egg-info/
# Ignore scripts/ contents (not the dir itself) so the one setup script below can be
# re-included -- a negation can't rescue a file whose parent dir is excluded outright.
scripts/*
# Track the PO-token provider setup script (dev checkout + Phase 3 CI both run it);
# the rest of scripts/ stays local-only.
!scripts/setup_pot_provider.py
# Track the yt-dlp channel checker -- test_ydl_player_client.py loads it from disk,
# so CI's clean checkout needs it present or TestChannelChecker fails.
!scripts/yt_dlp_channel.py
# Track the social preview generator -- test_make_social_preview.py loads it from disk.
!scripts/make_social_preview.py
# Ignore docs/ contents (not the dir itself) so the screenshot below can be re-included --
# a negation can't rescue a file whose parent dir is excluded outright.
docs/*
# Re-include the README's screenshot -- the rest of docs/ (planning notes) stays local-only.
!docs/screenshot.png
# Re-include the generated GitHub social preview card.
!docs/social-preview.png
vendor/bgutil-pot-provider/server/node_modules/
# Re-include the vendored lockfile that the global "*.lock" rule would exclude;
# `deno install --frozen` in scripts/setup_pot_provider.py needs it on a fresh checkout.
!vendor/bgutil-pot-provider/server/deno.lock